[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":98},["ShallowReactive",2],{"blog:archive:10":3},{"posts":4,"total":88,"tags":89,"tag":-1},[5,14,22,30,38,47,55,64,72,80],{"title":6,"link":7,"date":8,"dateTime":9,"description":10,"thumbnail":11,"tags":12},"總是從錯誤中學習，置之死地而後生 - 阿陰","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-18-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F18","2018-06-18","無關科系，沒有程式底子沒關係！只要有學習熱情","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2Fryin.png?alt=media&token=6fb5f324-c96d-439f-968d-6c6676463152",[13],"interview",{"title":15,"link":16,"date":17,"dateTime":18,"description":19,"thumbnail":20,"tags":21},"問自己未來想要什麼？我選擇與時俱進的工作 -- Joseph","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-17-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F17","2018-06-17","從事過設計助理、數位廣告代理商業務、倉管，在開始思考未來方向之際看到了六角學院，開啟了 coding 人生。半年內，一家大型電商公司主動聯繫，現在擔任前端工程師一職","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2F%E5%98%89%E8%B1%90.png?alt=media&token=0330137d-6221-423f-bd24-ac4116a93854",[13],{"title":23,"link":24,"date":25,"dateTime":26,"description":27,"thumbnail":28,"tags":29},"只要想著半年後的樣子，這樣的喜悅就能擊敗學習的孤獨感 - Greene","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-16-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F16","2018-06-16","跟朋友創業，為了自架網站，我重拾大學荒廢的學科，加入線上課程，雖然以資工背景出身，我依然從零開始","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2FGreene.png?alt=media&token=9ac54c5b-9785-4568-9a16-f03bf294d5de",[13],{"title":31,"link":32,"date":33,"dateTime":34,"description":35,"thumbnail":36,"tags":37},"專精一職，涉略所有，才能有無限可能 - Simon","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-06-15-interview","2018\u002F06\u002F15","2018-06-15","Simon 非資工相關科系畢業，在畢業前因為大學教授的一句話，開始接觸前端技術，加入了六角學院學習前端技術，但因南部相關職缺少之又少且待遇並不是很友善，決定北上另尋機會，且已順利找到第二份前端工程師工作。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F06%2Fsimon.png?alt=media&token=5721dbaa-202b-45c8-acaa-c02ac9a634b7",[13],{"title":39,"link":40,"date":41,"dateTime":42,"description":43,"thumbnail":44,"tags":45},"The F2E - 前端修練精神時光屋","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-05-09-the_f2e","2018\u002F05\u002F09","2018-05-09","你想變強嗎？你想獲得力量嗎？你想透過前端改變你的生活，但找不到地方修練嗎？如果你的答案是「Yes」那麼你來對地方了！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F05%2FTheF2E_banner.png?alt=media&token=4e663e89-554e-4bed-83ac-000fddabd8ab",[46],"skilltree",{"title":48,"link":49,"date":50,"dateTime":51,"description":52,"thumbnail":53,"tags":54},"2018 前端開發者學習地圖！","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-04-16-skill_tree","2018\u002F04\u002F16","2018-04-16","很多同學會問老師前端該學到哪裡？如果我是設計師，想走前端要學哪些技能？這邊老師提供前端開發者技能樹供同學參考參考。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F04%2F%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E6%A8%B9_banner.png?alt=media&token=c6940846-4660-4223-b828-c8ca567929c4",[46],{"title":56,"link":57,"date":58,"dateTime":59,"description":60,"thumbnail":61,"tags":62},"線上講座 - 簡報力就是你的說服力","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-04-11-keynote-king","2018\u002F04\u002F11","2018-04-11","工作、面試、報告中絕對免不了簡報，好的簡報不僅賞心悅目、提高內容的說服力，並且還能時時提醒自己接下來要介紹的內容，絕對是會議中的一等一神器。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F01%2Fkeynote_cover.png?alt=media&token=bd37bf3b-dc9f-4ec5-8f01-31e01cfc743f",[63],"event",{"title":65,"link":66,"date":67,"dateTime":68,"description":69,"thumbnail":70,"tags":71},"線上講座 - Node.js 的各種運用","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-01-16-jan-node","2018\u002F01\u002F16","2018-01-16","Node.js 課程中老師介紹了許多基礎的概念，但其實 Node.js 可以運用的層面非常的廣，光只靠老師的一堂課無法涵蓋所有的內容，因此我們從各地尋找優秀的講者，讓同學接觸更多不同的 Node.js 應用概念。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F01%2Fjan_cover.png?alt=media&token=d3bc0edf-1044-434f-962a-92f9a0c71a88",[63],{"title":73,"link":74,"date":75,"dateTime":76,"description":77,"thumbnail":78,"tags":79},"年紀的追趕下，擁有專業技能，才能踏實完成每一步 -- Chelsea","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-12-04-interview","2018\u002F01\u002F04","2018-01-04","大眾傳播系畢業後，從事廣告公司平面相關，工作的性質比較偏與人溝通想法，沒有實際自己動手完成的經驗，覺得工作總是出一張嘴，感覺很不踏實，在 2016 年國外打工回國後，認為應該培養一技之長，決定踏入前端這個深不見底的大坑(笑)","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F01%2Finterview_chelsea.jpg?alt=media&token=9b8374ca-1f94-47bc-9c14-d8ca7819afe0",[13],{"title":81,"link":82,"date":83,"dateTime":84,"description":85,"thumbnail":86,"tags":87},"學習前端半年，畢業即就業 -- 世軒","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-12-03-interview","2018\u002F01\u002F03","2018-01-03","很享受現在的工作生活，連女友的躍躍欲試，開始學習前端了！目前公司的前端、後端人員各一位，沒有前輩帶領的工作有好有壞，我可以獨當一面完成很多事，當然遇到問題無人可以解答時，我也會請教老師(笑)","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F01%2Finterview_%E4%B8%96%E8%BB%92.jpg?alt=media&token=192b56f8-0917-4d1f-9b3f-454f2902cae2",[13],122,[90,91,92,93,94,63,13,95,96,46,97],"UI design","course","css","css3","enterprise","javascript","jobs","software engineer",1791348123491]